WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,280
What happened to Tingting?

2
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:15,860
Even I can’t recognize Tingting. Turn around and show your brother. Don’t tell me.

3
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,100
Tingting has a really good foundation

4
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,100
The same clothes as before

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,060
Too inappropriate

6
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,580
Such a beautiful girl is taken as a brother by you

7
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,700
How is it buried?

8
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:25,570
You bought these for her

9
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,340
clothes shoes

10
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:30,060
There are also some things for girls

11
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:32,580
I think it suits her brother very well

12
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:35,910
Doesn’t it look good? It’s not Tingting

13
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:36,830
You get in the car and sit for a while

14
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:37,910
Let me have a few words with Mr. Zhang

15
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:42,020
Wait a minute and make a fool of yourself

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,820
I appreciate your fine clothes

17
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,220
But Tingting is still a student

18
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,580
What happened to the students?

19
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:49,740
Don’t students need to wear clothes?

20
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:51,640
I didn't mean that

21
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,070
what do you mean

22
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:55,070
The most important thing for her now is to study

23
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:57,700
You shouldn't focus on dressing up

24
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,820
Chen Yundong

25
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:00,220
I know you feel sorry for your sister

26
00:01:00,220 --> 00:01:02,280
I also hope she studies hard

27
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,280
But simplicity does not mean

28
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,440
Be sure to wear old clothes

29
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:07,180
Broken shoes, that teacher today

30
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:08,980
Why do you dare to say that about Tingting?

31
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:10,940
It’s not because her clothes are shabby and her family has no money

32
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:12,460
I think she's easy to bully

33
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:14,970
Of course it's the teacher's fault

34
00:01:15,010 --> 00:01:16,690
But have you ever thought about it

35
00:01:16,690 --> 00:01:19,010
Tingting faces these looks every day at school

36
00:01:19,010 --> 00:01:21,360
What does it feel like in my heart?

37
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:22,280
Say it again

38
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,560
I am the sister-in-law

39
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:26,630
What's wrong with buying some clothes for my sister?

40
00:01:26,630 --> 00:01:28,430
I mean today is a special situation
